(6255573, 924857, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  You did a fabulous job with the snowflakes, and the long shadows are divine.  Don''t know why, but this really appeals to me, more and more the longer I look at it.</td>', 'Very cool.  You did a fabulous job with the snowflakes, and the long shadows are divine.  Don''t know why, but this really appeals to me, more and more the longer I look at it.', '2010-12-16 11:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
