(6256003, 924561, 96751, '<td valign="top">Outstanding composition.  I''m praying this isn''t an overlay, which will get you DQ''d (I did the same thing once).  Regardless, it''s a fabulous image.<br/> <br/>I''ve come back to look at this and realize that it''s taken through a broken window.  Love it.</td>', 'Outstanding composition.  I''m praying this isn''t an overlay, which will get you DQ''d (I did the same thing once).  Regardless, it''s a fabulous image. I''ve come back to look at this and realize that it''s taken through a broken window.  Love it.', '2010-12-17 00:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256004, 925229, 96751, '<td valign="top">Quirky and wonderful study of an onion.</td>', 'Quirky and wonderful study of an onion.', '2010-12-17 00:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256006, 924459, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m going cross-eyed trying to figure out what that red thin is between the stalks.  It looks like a gem but it could be a fallen petal.  I think a different color background would strengthen the image.</td>', 'I''m going cross-eyed trying to figure out what that red thin is between the stalks.  It looks like a gem but it could be a fallen petal.  I think a different color background would strengthen the image.', '2010-12-17 00:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256008, 925004, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is front page stuff.  Not only the execution but the concept.  Bravo.</td>', 'This is front page stuff.  Not only the execution but the concept.  Bravo.', '2010-12-17 00:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256010, 924512, 96751, '<td valign="top">It does, in fact, look like he is taking off.  Beautifully framed and captured.</td>', 'It does, in fact, look like he is taking off.  Beautifully framed and captured.', '2010-12-17 00:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256011, 925150, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sweet portrait.  I think his chapped cheeks could use some smoothing :-)</td>', 'Sweet portrait.  I think his chapped cheeks could use some smoothing :-)', '2010-12-17 00:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256012, 924888, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very moody.  Lovely portrait.</td>', 'Very moody.  Lovely portrait.', '2010-12-17 00:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256013, 925078, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh wow.  What a great take on the challenge.  Quirky and sweet.  Just wish there as a little less space between her and "home"</td>', 'Oh wow.  What a great take on the challenge.  Quirky and sweet.  Just wish there as a little less space between her and "home"', '2010-12-17 00:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
