(6256439, 924857, 18197, '<td valign="top">Superb - firstly one of the most recognizable songs in the collection - one of the most iconic - and you gave it an original twist that''s both innovative and in character with the spirit of the song. Super!</td>', 'Superb - firstly one of the most recognizable songs in the collection - one of the most iconic - and you gave it an original twist that''s both innovative and in character with the spirit of the song. Super!', '2010-12-17 16:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
