(6256550, 925207, 52790, '<td valign="top">THANK YOU for actually capturing an imagine reminiscent of Lennon. I was really hoping to see more pictures that imbued his spirit instead of modern day interpretations. Well done!</td>', 'THANK YOU for actually capturing an imagine reminiscent of Lennon. I was really hoping to see more pictures that imbued his spirit instead of modern day interpretations. Well done!', '2010-12-17 20:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6256552, 924624, 52790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. I only have two thoughts I would like to share, both with the posing. I''d either like to see no eyelash at all, or more of the eye. And I wish you had had the model pull her arm away from her body slightly so that it wasn''t flattened against her shoulder.</td>', 'Beautiful image. I only have two thoughts I would like to share, both with the posing. I''d either like to see no eyelash at all, or more of the eye. And I wish you had had the model pull her arm away from her body slightly so that it wasn''t flattened against her shoulder.', '2010-12-17 20:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
