(6258470, 924626, 48456, '<td valign="top">Nice photo although for some reason it feels like you have photoshop-blurred the front plane since there are inconsistencies with what reality would look like if you were actually just in focus in one plane, ie. you forgot to blurr the bottom right part of the image, the building which seems to be way behind the tree would not have been this sharp, and so forth. The idea is good, I like the colours but in my opinion it could have been better executed.</td>', 'Nice photo although for some reason it feels like you have photoshop-blurred the front plane since there are inconsistencies with what reality would look like if you were actually just in focus in one plane, ie. you forgot to blurr the bottom right part of the image, the building which seems to be way behind the tree would not have been this sharp, and so forth. The idea is good, I like the colours but in my opinion it could have been better executed.', '2010-12-20 20:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
