(6259384, 924706, 122685, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by szalona:</b></div><hr/><i> Uninteresting to look at. Why did the labels in the photos?<br/>Finally, if these are meant to look like polaroids you should have made all the images square (colossus, zeus...) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I put labels in the photos cause that''s what i do with my photos. I like to write the place and the date (at the back cause i don''t have polaroids). Also i couldn''t make them all look the same.<br/>thanx for your comment.</td>', 'Originally posted by szalona: Uninteresting to look at. Why did the labels in the photos?Finally, if these are meant to look like polaroids you should have made all the images square (colossus, zeus...)  I put labels in the photos cause that''s what i do with my photos. I like to write the place and the date (at the back cause i don''t have polaroids). Also i couldn''t make them all look the same.thanx for your comment.', '2010-12-22 04:25:49.000000', NULL, 0),
