(6266126, 925004, 3936, '<td valign="top">Still...  A really cool image.  Very fitting to the challenge, and the man behind the music.  I like the way you focused the color on the glasses to make them really pop.  I also think your choice of flags is appropriate.  Lennon was from Britain, but the US was the major player in the war.  Nice work!</td>', 'Still...  A really cool image.  Very fitting to the challenge, and the man behind the music.  I like the way you focused the color on the glasses to make them really pop.  I also think your choice of flags is appropriate.  Lennon was from Britain, but the US was the major player in the war.  Nice work!', '2011-01-01 12:11:41.000000', NULL, 0),
